<section class="module-landing-banner mb-5" style="--hero-bg: url('../images/heroes/hero-dms.jpg');" aria-label="Introduction">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="module-landing-accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="module-landing-kicker mb-2">Document Management</p>
        <h1 class="module-landing-headline text-white mb-3">Document Management System for Enterprise</h1>
        <p class="module-landing-dek mb-4 col-lg-10 px-0">
            Organizations drowning in paper and email attachments require structured document management
            that transforms chaotic information into organized, searchable, and secure digital assets.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a href="#components" class="btn btn-light btn-sm px-4 fw-semibold">Module components</a>
            <a href="/#inquiry" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm px-4">Start a conversation</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <p>
            Our document management system replaces physical filing and email-chain-based document handling
            with a single searchable repository. Version control prevents the confusion of multiple document
            copies while approval workflows ensure proper authorization before documents become official
            records.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5" id="components">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Module Components</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
            The document management system provides integrated capabilities spanning the entire document 
            lifecycle from capture through collaboration. Each component addresses specific operational 
            needs while contributing to unified information governance.
        </p>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/dms/capture">Capture and Ingestion</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Multi-channel document capture converting paper and digital content into searchable 
                    records. Scanner integration, email ingestion, mobile capture, and OCR processing 
                    with barcode recognition automate document digitization.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/dms/classification">Classification and Metadata</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Intelligent document organization with folder hierarchy and mandatory metadata 
                    fields. Automatic classification and sensitivity management ensure appropriate 
                    handling from document entry through disposal.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/dms/versioncontrol">Version Control</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Complete document version history with check-out and check-in mechanisms preventing 
                    simultaneous edit conflicts. Version comparison and rollback capabilities maintain 
                    document integrity through multiple revision cycles.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/dms/workflow">Approval and Workflow</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Configurable document approval workflows with sequential and parallel routing paths. 
                    Digital signature capture, deadline management, and comprehensive audit trails 
                    ensure proper authorization before document publication.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/dms/search">Search and Retrieval</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Powerful full-text search across OCR-indexed document content with metadata filtering. 
                    Boolean operators, saved searches, and relevance ranking enable instant discovery 
                    of required documents across the entire repository.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/dms/security">Access Control and Security</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Role-based access control with folder and document-level permissions. Watermarking, 
                    download restrictions, and comprehensive audit logging protect sensitive information 
                    aligned with ISO 27001 standards.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/dms/retention">Retention and Disposal</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Automated records retention with configurable schedules and legal hold workflows. 
                    Secure disposal processes with destruction certificates ensure compliance with 
                    ISO 15489 and regulatory retention requirements.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/dms/collaboration">Collaboration and Sharing</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Secure document collaboration with internal and external sharing capabilities. 
                    Annotation tools, co-authoring support, and email integration enable team 
                    productivity without compromising document security.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/dms/backgroundprocessing">Background Processing</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Queue-based document processing using Quartz.NET scheduling for OCR batch operations, 
                    PDF conversion, and thumbnail generation. Background execution ensures resource-intensive 
                    tasks do not impact user experience.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Digital Transformation Foundation</h2>
        <p>
            Document management serves as the foundation for digital transformation initiatives 
            eliminating paper-based processes that constrain operational efficiency. Digitized documents 
            become searchable data assets rather than physical files requiring manual retrieval 
            and handling.
        </p>
        <p>
            Integration with business processes enables document-driven workflow automation. 
            Invoices trigger approval workflows automatically while contracts route through 
            legal review based on document classification without manual routing decisions.
        </p>
        <p>
            Mobile accessibility extends document availability beyond office boundaries enabling 
            field staff to capture, review, and approve documents from any location. This 
            flexibility supports modern work patterns while maintaining security and compliance.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Information Governance</h2>
        <p>
            Comprehensive information governance ensures documents remain available when needed 
            but dispose appropriately when retention periods expire. Retention schedules align 
            with regulatory requirements and business needs preventing premature destruction 
            or indefinite accumulation.
        </p>
        <p>
            Audit trails document every document interaction supporting compliance demonstration 
            and forensic investigation. Who viewed which documents when becomes answerable 
            through comprehensive logging rather than speculation or memory.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Standards and Compliance</h2>
        <p>
            The document management system aligns with ISO 9001 for document control, ISO 27001 
            for information security, and ISO 15489 for records management. These internationally 
            recognized standards provide framework alignment that auditors and regulators expect.
        </p>
        <p>
            GDPR principles guide personal data handling within documents ensuring privacy 
            compliance across jurisdictions. Retention limitations, access controls, and secure 
            disposal support data protection requirements without manual policy enforcement.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

